查看dhcp服务状态
1
systemctl status isc-dhcp-server
重启服务
1
systemctl restart isc-dhcp-server
查看租约文件dhcpd.leases
1
vim /var/lib/dhcp/dhcpd.leases
编辑dhcp配置文件
1
vim /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf
显示客户端
1
dhcp-lease-list
检查dhcp配置文件是否有语法问题
1
dhcpd -t -cf /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf
查看10分钟之前到现在的日志
1
journalctl -u isc-dhcp-server --since "10 minutes ago"